---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="页面未找到"
  description="抱歉，你访问的页面不存在或已被移动。"
  robots="noindex, nofollow"
>
  <section
    class="error-page mx-auto grid min-h-[62vh] max-w-5xl items-center gap-12 px-6 py-16 sm:py-20 lg:grid-cols-[minmax(0,1fr)_minmax(17rem,0.72fr)] lg:gap-20"
  >
    <div class="max-w-xl">
      <p class="error-status font-mono text-xs font-medium tracking-[0.12em]">
        <span aria-hidden="true" class="error-status-dot"></span>
        404 / NOT FOUND
      </p>

      <h1 class="mt-3 text-4xl weight-display tracking-tight sm:text-5xl">
        页面未找到
      </h1>

      <p class="mt-5 text-lg leading-8 text-ink-muted">
        抱歉，你访问的页面不存在、已被移动，或地址输入有误。
      </p>

      <div class="mt-8 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-3">
        <a href="/" class="button-primary gap-2 text-sm">
          <svg
            aria-hidden="true"
            viewBox="0 0 24 24"
            fill="none"
            stroke="currentColor"
            stroke-width="1.75"
            class="size-4"
          >
            <path
              stroke-linecap="round"
              stroke-linejoin="round"
              d="m4.75 10.5 7.25-6 7.25 6v8.75h-5v-5h-4.5v5h-5V10.5Z"
            ></path>
          </svg>
          返回首页
        </a>

        <a href="/blog" class="button-secondary gap-2 text-sm">
          查看博客
          <svg
            aria-hidden="true"
            viewBox="0 0 24 24"
            fill="none"
            stroke="currentColor"
            stroke-width="1.75"
            class="size-4"
          >
            <path
              stroke-linecap="round"
              stroke-linejoin="round"
              d="M5 12h14m-5-5 5 5-5 5"
            ></path>
          </svg>
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div aria-hidden="true" class="error-visual">
      <div class="error-visual-frame">
        <svg
          viewBox="0 0 320 240"
          fill="none"
          class="error-route"
          focusable="false"
        >
          <path
            d="M28 177c44-8 52-62 95-67 38-4 45 43 86 34 35-8 40-46 83-52"
            pathLength="1"
          ></path>
          <circle cx="28" cy="177" r="5"></circle>
          <circle cx="292" cy="92" r="5"></circle>
        </svg>

        <span class="error-code weight-display-latin">404</span>
        <span class="error-visual-label font-mono">route_not_found</span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>

<style>
  .error-status {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.625rem;
    color: var(--site-accent);
  }

  .error-status-dot {
    width: 0.45rem;
    height: 0.45rem;
    border-radius: 9999px;
    background: currentColor;
    box-shadow: 0 0 0 0.3rem
      color-mix(in srgb, var(--site-accent-soft) 72%, transparent);
  }

  .error-visual {
    width: 100%;
    max-width: 22rem;
    margin-inline: auto;
  }

  .error-visual-frame {
    position: relative;
    display: grid;
    aspect-ratio: 4 / 3;
    place-items: center;
    overflow: hidden;
    border: 1px solid color-mix(in srgb, var(--site-line) 62%, transparent);
    border-radius: var(--site-radius-panel);
    background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--site-surface) 70%, transparent);
    box-shadow:
      inset 0 1px 0 rgb(255 255 255 / 58%),
      0 20px 52px rgb(44 75 62 / 8%);
    -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(14px) saturate(108%);
    backdrop-filter: blur(14px) saturate(108%);
  }

  .error-route {
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    color: var(--site-line-strong);
  }

  .error-route path {
    stroke: currentColor;
    stroke-width: 1.25;
    stroke-dasharray: 0.035 0.03;
    stroke-linecap: round;
    opacity: 0.46;
    animation: error-route-drift 14s linear infinite;
  }

  .error-route circle {
    fill: var(--site-surface);
    stroke: var(--site-accent);
    stroke-width: 2;
  }

  .error-code {
    position: relative;
    color: var(--site-accent);
    font-size: clamp(4.5rem, 9vw, 6.5rem);
    letter-spacing: -0.055em;
    line-height: 1;
  }

  .error-visual-label {
    position: absolute;
    right: 1.25rem;
    bottom: 1.1rem;
    color: var(--site-ink-faint);
    font-size: 0.7rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
  }

  :global(html[data-theme='dark']) .error-visual-frame {
    border-color: rgb(255 255 255 / 7%);
    background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--site-surface) 76%, transparent);
    box-shadow:
      inset 0 1px 0 rgb(255 255 255 / 3%),
      0 22px 58px rgb(0 0 0 / 18%);
  }

  @keyframes error-route-drift {
    to {
      stroke-dashoffset: -1;
    }
  }

  @media (max-width: 63.999rem) {
    .error-visual {
      max-width: 20rem;
      margin-inline: 0;
    }
  }

  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
    .error-route path {
      animation: none;
    }
  }
</style>
